            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Donnal M. Lach, the case concerns whether Congress intended to include local governments within the definition of \u201cperson\u201d under the False Claims Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Donnal M. Lach",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7925dc3d948936f7a12a25a77917267968705e8d941adcf36427a7fc286a9233",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7925dc3d9489-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Donnal M. Lach, the False Claims Act has both criminal and civil provisions, with the criminal provisions codified separately since 1878."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Stewart",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7925dc3d948936f7a12a25a77917267968705e8d941adcf36427a7fc286a9233",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7925dc3d9489-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Stewart, local governments receive substantial federal funds, and fraud by them can cause harms similar to private parties."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Stewart",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7925dc3d948936f7a12a25a77917267968705e8d941adcf36427a7fc286a9233",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7925dc3d9489-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 34,
              "start": 34
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Since 1986, 138 qui tam suits have been filed against local governments, with the United States intervening in 13 of them."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Stewart",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7925dc3d948936f7a12a25a77917267968705e8d941adcf36427a7fc286a9233",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7925dc3d9489-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Treasury has recovered over $10\u202fbillion from False Claims Act suits since 1986."
      }
    ],
